# Shell scripts and SQL files are fed to tools that reject carriage returns.
# core.autocrlf is true on this repo's Windows checkouts, so the next checkout
# would hand bash a CRLF copy of scripts/db/*.sh, and bash fails on the first
# meaningful line with "$'\r': command not found". Pin them to LF everywhere.
#
# Deliberately narrow. A repo-wide `* text=auto` would govern normalization for
# all 380 tracked files, and src/collections/** must stay byte-identical.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
